  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 510.11 Construction Phase Submittal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 510.11 Construction Phase Submittal. During the construction phase of the project, the recipient shall submit:\n\n(a) A notice of completion of construction to the department, upon completion of project construction; and\n\n(b) Any other construction-phase submittals required by the financial assistance documents to be submitted for the department's approval.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq500.html"
